@startuml
|Browser|
start
:Guest adds product to cart;
if (cart_session_id in localStorage?) then (no)
  :Generate session id and store it;
endif
:Send POST /api/cart/items\nwith X-Cart-Session header;
|Backend|
:Validate product & stock;
:Upsert GuestCart by sessionId\n(expiresAt = now + 30 days);
:Return cart with subtotal, tax, shipping, total (EUR);
|Browser|
:Guest logs in / registers\n(body includes cartSessionId);
|Backend|
:Authenticate user & issue JWT;
if (GuestCart exists for sessionId?) then (yes)
  :Load or create user Cart;
  :Merge items (sum quantities per product);
  :Save user Cart;
  :Delete GuestCart;
endif
:Return token + user;
|Browser|
:Remove cart_session_id from localStorage;
:Refresh cart from GET /api/cart (JWT);
stop
@enduml